Depends: libc6 (>= 2.39), libssl3, libgl1, libegl1, libglx0, libx11-6, libxcursor1, libxrandr2, libxi6, libsm6, libxkbcommon0, libwayland-client0, zlib1g, libbrotli1, libzstd1
Description: Fab and Megascans asset browser and DCC exporter
 AssetCraft signs you in with your Epic launcher session, browses the
 Fab and Megascans catalogs, downloads what you own into a local
 library you control, and exports assets into Blender with meshes,
 PBR materials and textures attached. This package installs the
 command line tool (assetcraft) and the desktop app (assetcraft-gui).
